  "prefLabel": "Tre 213.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tre 213.02 Applicability. The rules in this part shall apply whenever any person has a right under applicable law to request a rehearing of a decision prior to filing an appeal of the decision with the court having appellate jurisdiction.\n\nSource. #7589-A, eff 11-7-01; ss by #9575-A, eff 10-22-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tre200.html"
